# **Project Documentation**

## Introduction
The AI Chatbot is a web-based application used to interact with users, answer questions, and automate conversational tasks using an AI model.

## Features
- User registration and login
- Real-time text-based chat interface
- Chat history logs (Save and load past conversations)
- Export chat transcripts (Download as PDF or TXT)

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript (Frontend UI / API integration / LocalStorage for history)

## Installation
1. Download the project.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open index.html in a browser.

## Usage
1. Login to the system.
2. Open a new chat session.
3. Type a message in the input box and press send.
4. View the AI response in real-time.

## Future Enhancements
- Voice input and output (Speech-to-Text and Text-to-Speech)
- Multi-modal support (Uploading images and files)

